 "description": "Fetch a SPECIFIC NAMED Last.fm user's most-scrobbled tracks for a given period (overall/7day/1month/3month/6month/12month) \u2014 only when the question names a Last.fm username; NEVER for general \"popular songs / top music\" questions (use chart_top_artists or tag_top_artists for those) and never with a guessed or example username. Returns track names, artists, and play counts.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "user": "rj"
   },
   {
    "limit": 20,
    "period": "7day",
    "user": "lastfmuser"
   }
  ],
